4 0 obj
<<
/Creator ( )
/Producer ( )
/Author (Willenborg, David Lee;Hendricks, Charles D.)
/Keywords (*FOCUSING;*PLASMA DEVICES;CONSTRUCTION;ENGINEERING;SCIENTIFIC RESEARCH;INSTRUMENTATION;MAGNETOHYDRODYNAMICS;X RAYS;PLASMAS\(PHYSICS\);PULSES)
/Subject (This paper deals with the design of a dense plasma focus device as an engineering project. Essentially this approach can be summarized as follows First, an introduction dealing with a general discussion of plasma devices focusing on the role of a dense plasma focus device as a useful tool in future research second, an explanation of the operation of the dense plasma focus third, a general design discussion of the dense plasma focus device fourth, specification of a realizable system and finally, a discussion of the problems encountered in constructing this design and observations concerning the effectiveness of this dense plasma focus design. Author)
/Title (Design and Construction of a Dense Plasma Focus Device)
/Filename (/pdf/TR/ADA037245.pdf)
>>
